<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
	<<covered>> There's a pile of cloth scraps in an adjoining room. Some are large enough to wear, or dry your clothes with.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mines Guards]]>><<ragup>><<dry_full>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif random(1, 3) is 3 and $eventskip isnot 1>>
